# PROTOTYPE for issue 488. Never merge.
#
# Every tracked path, sorted into the two halves the classifier rule needs:
# `build` starts Build, `-build` does not. The `build` lines are the list that
# "Which tracked paths do the jobs of build.yml read?" found. A path no line
# reaches is unspecified, and the lint refuses it.
#
# Read the way .config/readers is read: gitattributes patterns, a later line
# wins over an earlier one.

.github/**                    -build
.github/workflows/build.yml   build
.config/mise.toml             build
.config/mise.lock             build
.config/tasks.toml            build
.config/readers               -build
.config/cliff.toml            -build
/Cargo.toml                   build
/Cargo.lock                   build
src/**                        build
/pyproject.toml               build
/README.md                    build
/LICENSE                      build
.gitignore                    build
.gitattributes                build

/AGENTS.md                    -build
/CLAUDE.md                    -build
/CONTEXT.md                   -build
/CONTRIBUTING.md              -build
/LANDSCAPE.md                 -build
/deny.toml                    -build
/prek.toml                    -build
/.editorconfig                -build
/.shellcheckrc                -build
docs/**                       -build
scripts/**                    -build
